      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    unlevered_firm_value = 800000\n    tax_rate = 0.28\n    debt = 300000\n    interest_rate = 0.05\n    periods = 5\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    annual_interest = debt * interest_rate\n    annual_tax_shield = annual_interest * tax_rate\n    pv_tax_shield = annual_tax_shield * (\n        1 - (1 / (1 + interest_rate) ** periods)\n    ) / interest_rate\n    apv = unlevered_firm_value + pv_tax_shield\n\n    # Return answer rounded to the nearest integer\n    return round(apv)\n```",
